@startuml
title UC-008 Find the items of the navigation of each kind of activity
start
:The task starts at night, or an administrator selects Find items;
repeat :Take a kind of activity that is turned on;
  if (The site has activities of the kind?) then (yes)
    repeat :Take one of the most recent activities;
      :Build its secondary navigation as its page would;
      if (Built?) then (yes)
        :Key each item (its key, or the path of its address);
      else (no)
        :Give no items;
      endif
    repeat while (More activities and time left?) is (yes)
    :Record the items new to the navigation of the kind;
  else (no)
  endif
repeat while (More kinds?) is (yes)
stop
@enduml
